		<item>
		<title>&#8220;He was a great rival and a great person&#8221;</title>
		<link>http://www.ericdanforthmudama.org/?p=141</link>
		
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[Monique Mudama]]></dc:creator>
		<pubDate>Mon, 26 Mar 2018 21:57:59 +0000</pubDate>
				<category><![CDATA[Uncategorized]]></category>
		<guid isPermaLink="false">http://52.42.184.240/?p=141</guid>

					<description><![CDATA[I first met Gos back in Ultima Online, he was part of an opposing guild and we used to thrash each other in the guild wars.  We ended up being in the same guild back then.  We met back up again in Afterlife* by chance.  He was a great rival and a great person. Kaganos [&#8230;]]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>I first met Gos back in Ultima Online, he was part of an opposing guild and we used to thrash each other in the guild wars.  We ended up being in the same guild back then.  We met back up again in Afterlife* by chance.  He was a great rival and a great person.</p>
<p>Kaganos</p>
<p>* Afterlife was a gaming guild. Eric was a member of Afterlife in EverQuest and World of Warcraft.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
					
		
		
			</item>
